      "claim": "A decrease in stream velocity reduces the kinetic energy and shear stress exerted on the stream bed.",
      "evidence": "Kinetic energy ∝ v²; shear stress τ ≈ ρ g R S, both decline as velocity v declines.",
      "weight": 0.25,
